  ('reliablesf', 'scaffolding', 'Adjustable Telescopic Steel Acrow Prop for Construction Shoring', null, 'Adjustable Telescopic Steel Acrow Prop for Construction Shoring. Customized Dimensions: Length, width, plate size, and tube diameter are fully customizable to suit specific project requirements. Hot Dip Galvanized Finish: Provides superior corrosion resistance for outdoor construction and long-term durability. Stable Support System: Ensures secure connection and reduces movement or shaking during formwork installation. Versatile Applications: Suitable for wall formwork, column formwork, panel alignment, bridge engineering, and shipbuilding. Durable Steel Construction: Made of high-strength steel designed for repeated use to reduce replacement frequency and costs. Easy Installation: Simple structure allows quicker installation and removal, improving on-site working efficiency. Complete System Support: Includes base plates, formwork braces, and heavy-duty alignment props for comprehensive support. Professional Customization: Supported by a design team for project-based customization from samples or designs.', null, '[{"label_en":"Connection Type","label_es":"Connection Type","value":"Clamp Connection"},{"label_en":"Finish","label_es":"Finish","value":"Galvanized"},{"label_en":"Material","label_es":"Material","value":"Steel"},{"label_en":"Type","label_es":"Tipo","value":"Scaffold Couplers"},{"label_en":"Product Name","label_es":"Product Name","value":"Fixed Push Pull Prop"},{"label_en":"Product Type","label_es":"Product Type","value":"Formwork Support Component"},{"label_en":"Surface Treatment","label_es":"Tratamiento de superficie","value":"Hot DIP Galvanized"},{"label_en":"Plate Size","label_es":"Plate Size","value":"Customized"},{"label_en":"Tube Diameter","label_es":"Tube Diameter","value":"Customized"},{"label_en":"Application","label_es":"Aplicación","value":"Wall Formwork / Column Formwork / Panel Alignment"}]', 'ton', 20, 15, 1100, array['https://image.made