  ('lianggongformwork', 'scaffolding', 'Lightweight Plastic Beam Column Slab Wall Formwork for Low-Cost Housing Projects', null, 'Lightweight Plastic Beam Column Slab Wall Formwork for Low-Cost Housing Projects. High-Quality ABS Material: Made of high-strength ABS plastic, ensuring durability and resistance to water and rust. Cost-Effective Reusability: Reusable over 100 times, significantly more cost-effective than traditional plywood formwork. Lightweight & Manual Handling: Weighs around 15kg/sqm; can be handled by a single person without heavy lifting equipment. Interlocking Design: Features smooth joints and interlocking panels, eliminating the need for release agents. Versatile Application: Suitable for walls, slabs, beams, and adjustable circular or rectangular columns. One-Stop After-Sales Service: Provides consulting, design, remote/on-site instruction, and comprehensive support. Customization Options: Offers customization from samples, designs, and flexible minor adjustments. Professional Manufacturer: Direct factory with 15 years export experience, ISO certified, and 12 R&D engineers.', null, '[{"label_en":"Material","label_es":"Material","value":"Plastic"},{"label_en":"Type","label_es":"Tipo","value":"Wall Formwork"},{"label_en":"Color","label_es":"Color","value":"Black"},{"label_en":"Thickness","label_es":"Espesor","value":"75mm"},{"label_en":"Size","label_es":"Tamaño","value":"See The Description"},{"label_en":"Application","label_es":"Aplicación","value":"Column Concret Construction"},{"label_en":"Max Size","label_es":"Max Size","value":"1200*600mm"},{"label_en":"Weight","label_es":"Peso","value":"Around 15kg/Sqm"},{"label_en":"Usage Time","label_es":"Usage Time","value":"More Than 150 Times"},{"label_en":"MOQ","label_es":"MOQ","value":"300square Meters"}]', 'm2', 300, 15, 50, array['https://image.made-in-china.com/203f0j00dmiWyElhnpYI/Lightweight-Plastic-Beam-Column-Slab-Wall-Formwork-for-Low-Cost-Housing-Projects.webp', 'https://image.made-in-china.c