  ('lianggongformwork', 'scaffolding', 'Lianggong Early Stripping Steel Drop Head Slab Formwork for Construction', null, 'Lianggong Early Stripping Steel Drop Head Slab Formwork for Construction. Modular Drop Head Design: Interlocking panels allow quick assembly and disassembly for various slab shapes. Customizable Dimensions: Size and thickness are fully customizable to meet specific project requirements. Customizable Colors: Available in Blue, Red, or fully customized color options. High Efficiency Production: Capable of covering up to 400 m2 per day with a 4-worker team. Lightweight Hand-held Design: Largest panel is 1800x1200mm with a weight of only 44kg for easy handling. Comprehensive One-Stop Service: Includes consulting, design, manufacturing, and remote or on-site instruction. ISO Certified Quality: Manufactured with 100% inspection and adherence to varied regional norms. 1-Year Warranty Coverage: Provides a 1-year warranty for mechanical defects and quality assurance.', null, '[{"label_en":"Material","label_es":"Material","value":"Steel"},{"label_en":"Type","label_es":"Tipo","value":"Slab Formwork"},{"label_en":"Color","label_es":"Color","value":"Blue, Red, Customized"},{"label_en":"Size","label_es":"Tamaño","value":"Customized"},{"label_en":"Surface Treatment","label_es":"Tratamiento de superficie","value":"Painted"},{"label_en":"Thickness","label_es":"Espesor","value":"Customized"},{"label_en":"Steel Type","label_es":"Steel Type","value":"Q235 Q345"}]', 'ton', 10, 15, 899, array['https://image.made-in-china.com/203f0j00oreZAwKyDskO/Lianggong-Early-Stripping-Steel-Drop-Head-Slab-Formwork-for-Construction.webp', 'https://image.made-in-china.com/203f0j00CLjBRtkahrcm/Lianggong-Early-Stripping-Steel-Drop-Head-Slab-Formwork-for-Construction.webp', 'https://image.made-in-china.com/203f0j00CDjvflkrEgqd/Lianggong-Early-Stripping-Steel-Drop-Head-Slab-Formwork-for-Construction.webp', 'https://image.made-in-china.com/203f0j00vIKBRechluqJ/Lianggong-Early-Stripping-St