  ('lianggongformwork', 'scaffolding', 'Light Weight Modular Aluminum Frame Skydeck Formwork with Fast Installation and Disassembly', null, 'Light Weight Modular Aluminum Frame Skydeck Formwork with Fast Installation and Disassembly. Lightweight Aluminum Design: Aluminum panels weigh only 16.2kg, allowing easy manual handling and reducing labor costs. Rapid Installation System: Features a drophead principle for striking after just one day, speeding up construction cycles. High Load Capacity: Supports fresh concrete pressure up to 60KN/m2 with sturdy aluminum props and beams. Modular & Flexible: Adjustable steel clamps and specialized accessories allow flexible solutions for columns and edges. Durable Reusability: Designed for 5-10 years of reuse, providing a cost-effective solution for long-term projects. Professional After-Sales: Provides online technical support and onsite installation guidance to ensure customer satisfaction. Custom Design Service: Offers customized forming and shoring proposals based on customer structural drawings via Auto-CAD. Certified Quality: ISO certified with 100% finished product inspection, ensuring high quality standards for global markets.', null, '[{"label_en":"Material","label_es":"Material","value":"Aluminum"},{"label_en":"Type","label_es":"Tipo","value":"Slab Formwork"},{"label_en":"Application","label_es":"Aplicación","value":"Slab Concrete Construction"},{"label_en":"Surface","label_es":"Surface","value":"Powder Coated"},{"label_en":"Color","label_es":"Color","value":"Yellow"},{"label_en":"Feature","label_es":"Feature","value":"High Strength, Modular Structure, Easy to Use"},{"label_en":"Design","label_es":"Design","value":"Lianggong"},{"label_en":"Reusable Times","label_es":"Reusable Times","value":"5~10 Years Reusable"}]', 'm2', 1000, 15, 230, array['https://image.made-in-china.com/203f0j00tJKegYIrHPkc/Light-Weight-Modular-Aluminum-Frame-Skydeck-Formwork-with-Fast-Installation-and-Disassembly.webp', 'https://image.made-in-chin