  ('lianggongform', 'scaffolding', 'Lightweight Structured Corrosion Resistant Efficient Aluminum Formwork for Wall and Slab Construction', null, 'Lightweight Structured Corrosion Resistant Efficient Aluminum Formwork for Wall and Slab Construction. Customizable Color Options: Available in Red, Blue, or fully customized colors to meet project needs. Versatile Construction Application: Suitable for walls, columns, slabs, beams, stairs, and balconies in a single operation. High Efficiency & Stiffness: No assembly required, easy operation, and high stiffness for perfect concrete shapes. Flexible Shaft Beam Specs: Shaft beams range from 1.45m to 5.8m, adaptable to various shaft widths. Comprehensive After-Sales Support: One-stop service including remote or on-site technical instruction and guidance. Certified Quality Assurance: Products certified with ISO, ROHS, and CE standards for global compliance. Durable Aluminum Material: Constructed from corrosion-resistant aluminum with T3-T8 temper for longevity. Fast Delivery Options: Typically 5-15 days for stock items, or 15-20 days for custom orders.', null, '[{"label_en":"Material","label_es":"Material","value":"Aluminum"},{"label_en":"Type","label_es":"Tipo","value":"Aluminum Formwork"},{"label_en":"Colour","label_es":"Colour","value":"Red, Blue, Customized"},{"label_en":"Advantage","label_es":"Advantage","value":"Quick Assemble"},{"label_en":"Technical Suppor","label_es":"Technical Suppor","value":"Remote or on-Site Instruction"},{"label_en":"Surface Treatmen","label_es":"Surface Treatmen","value":"Painted"},{"label_en":"Temper","label_es":"Temple","value":"T3-T8"}]', 'set', 10, 15, 999, array['https://image.made-in-china.com/203f0j00wrbsSRucQOqA/Lightweight-Structured-Corrosion-Resistant-Efficient-Aluminum-Formwork-for-Wall-and-Slab-Construction.webp', 'https://image.made-in-china.com/203f0j00JzbSZIurwOkw/Lightweight-Structured-Corrosion-Resistant-Efficient-Aluminum-Formwork-for-Wall-and-Slab-Construction.webp', 'https: