  ('lianggongform', 'scaffolding', 'Lianggong Manufacture Aluminum Skydeck Formwork for Slab Concrete Construction', null, 'Lianggong Manufacture Aluminum Skydeck Formwork for Slab Concrete Construction. Lightweight Aluminum Design: Panels weigh as little as 16.2kg with high loading capacity for efficient handling. High Load Capacity Props: Aluminum props support up to 90KN with a density of only 0.3 pieces per square meter. Customizable Dimensions: Available in various lengths from 800mm to 6250mm to fit specific project needs. Flexible Infill Solutions: Specially designed accessories allow for easy infill around columns and slab edges. Rapid Assembly & Stripping: Easy learning sequence with early stripping heads reduces on-site material requirements. Durable Powder Coating: Frames and beams are powder-coated for effortless and fast cleaning after use. Remote and On-Site Support: Engineers provide guidance via remote connection or on-site instruction for installation. ISO Certified Quality: Manufactured with ISO9001:2015 certification and professional quality inspection teams.', null, '[{"label_en":"Material","label_es":"Material","value":"Aluminum Alloy"},{"label_en":"Type","label_es":"Tipo","value":"Slab Formwork"},{"label_en":"Brand","label_es":"Marca","value":"LG"},{"label_en":"Technical Suppor","label_es":"Technical Suppor","value":"Remote or on-Site Instruction"},{"label_en":"Application","label_es":"Aplicación","value":"Building Construction"},{"label_en":"Color","label_es":"Color","value":"Customized"},{"label_en":"Product Name","label_es":"Product Name","value":"Skydeck Aluminium Frame Formwok"},{"label_en":"MOQ","label_es":"MOQ","value":"500square Meters"},{"label_en":"After-Sale Service","label_es":"After-Sale Service","value":"Online Technical Support, Onsite Installation, Ons"},{"label_en":"Project Soluction Capacity","label_es":"Project Soluction Capacity","value":"Graphic Design, Total Solution for Projects"}]', 'm2', 100, 15, 120, array['https://ima