  ('sdjiuyang', 'steel-pipes', 'Q235 Seamless Carbon Steel Pipe for Structure and Engineering', null, 'Q235 Seamless Carbon Steel Pipe for Structure and Engineering. Formed by solid steel billet piercing, no welding seam, completely eliminate weld cracking & leakage hazards, far safer than welded pipes under high pressure. Integral rolled structure, internal metal fiber continuous, excellent impact resistance, anti-burst performance for extreme working conditions. Hot rolled / cold drawn process, consistent wall thickness, tight OD & ID tolerance, good straightness & roundness, easy secondary machining (cutting, bending, flanging). Smooth inner wall reduces fluid friction, less scaling, improves pipeline transmission efficiency, lower maintenance cost. High tensile strength & toughness, withstand hydraulic shock, external extrusion and long-term cyclic pressure. Added Cr, Mo, V alloy elements, outstanding heat resistance & corrosion resistance, stable performance under high temp, acid & alkali medium, ideal for boiler, petrochemical pipeline. Higher hardness & creep resistance, suitable for high-temperature power plant, oil & gas drilling heavy-duty projects. Standard 20#, A106 Gr.B, Q345 carbon steel, balanced strength & cost, mature stable performance for construction, water gas pipeline, mechanical structure. Good machinability, easy welding & forming, widely used in general industrial engineering with low overall investment.', null, '[{"label_en":"Type","label_es":"Tipo","value":"Seamless"},{"label_en":"Technique","label_es":"Technique","value":"Cold Drawn"},{"label_en":"Material","label_es":"Material","value":"Carbon Steel"},{"label_en":"Surface Treatment","label_es":"Tratamiento de superficie","value":"Black"},{"label_en":"Section Shape","label_es":"Section Shape","value":"Round"},{"label_en":"Tolerance Standard","label_es":"Tolerance Standard","value":"±1%"},{"label_en":"Od","label_es":"Od","value":"6mm-1200mm"},{"label_en":"Wall Thickness","label_es":"Espeso