  ('sdjiuyang', 'roofing-sheets', 'Metal Roofing Sheet Material Zinc Coated Hot Dipped Galvanized Steel Coil', null, 'Metal Roofing Sheet Material Zinc Coated Hot Dipped Galvanized Steel Coil. Grade & Material: High-grade DX51D, SGCC, and ASTM A653 standards, suitable for deep drawing and structural use. Superior Corrosion Resistance: Hot-dipped galvanizing process with a zinc layer ranging from 30g/m2 to 275g/m 2 for long-term protection. Surface Quality: Available in Zero, Minimum, Regular, or Big spangle with optional anti-fingerprint and oiled treatment. Precision Thickness: Advanced rolling technology ensures uniform thickness with a tolerance of within 0.02mm. Versatile Application: Widely used in roofing sheets, corrugated tiles, automotive parts, and household appliance panels. Packing & Shipment: Standard sea-worthy export packing with inner paper sleeve, steel protectors, and multiple metal straps.', null, '[{"label_en":"Standard","label_es":"Norma","value":"ASTM, JIS, GB, DIN"},{"label_en":"Surface Treatment","label_es":"Tratamiento de superficie","value":"Galvanized"},{"label_en":"Technique","label_es":"Technique","value":"Hot Rolled"},{"label_en":"Application","label_es":"Aplicación","value":"Roofing Sheet"},{"label_en":"Edge","label_es":"Edge","value":"Slit edge"},{"label_en":"Stock","label_es":"Stock","value":"Stock"},{"label_en":"MOQ","label_es":"MOQ","value":"25tons"},{"label_en":"Zinc Coating","label_es":"Zinc Coating","value":"30-275G/M2"},{"label_en":"Delivery Time","label_es":"Delivery Time","value":"8 ~ 14 Days"},{"label_en":"Thickness","label_es":"Espesor","value":"0.11-3.0mm"}]', 'ton', 25, 15, 570, array['https://image.made-in-china.com/203f0j00iEjZckwJcmob/Metal-Roofing-Sheet-Material-Zinc-Coated-Hot-Dipped-Galvanized-Steel-Coil.webp', 'https://image.made-in-china.com/203f0j00hQKjcZdneJob/Metal-Roofing-Sheet-Material-Zinc-Coated-Hot-Dipped-Galvanized-Steel-Coil.webp', 'https://image.made-in-china.com/203f0j00iESjbwJGGdko/Metal-Roofing-Sheet