  ('tiantaiformwork', 'scaffolding', 'Steel-Framed Timber Formwork Allows Easy Construction and Long Turnover Cycles', null, 'Steel-Framed Timber Formwork Allows Easy Construction and Long Turnover Cycles. Easy assembly & high construction efficiency Standard modular steel frames with moderate panel weight allow single-person handling. Special matching clamps eliminate on-site welding, speeding up formw. Smooth concrete finish with minimal leakage Rigid steel frames resist bulging and deformation. Combined with timber plywood panels, they produce flat concrete surfaces with little slurry leakage and r. Long turnover cycles & low comprehensive cost Anti-rust steel frames withstand impact damage and support over 50 reuses under proper maintenance. Worn timber panels can be replaced separately instead. Light weight for wide application Much lighter than all-steel formwork, easy to transport by crane or manpower. Suitable for cast-in-place concrete structures including shear walls, beams, columns, re. High structural stability & construction safety Uniform force distribution of steel frames delivers strong resistance to concrete lateral pressure, effectively preventing form bulging or bursting. Sta. Low damage during disassembly & easy maintenance No cutting or welding during assembly/disassembly minimizes frame deformation. Neat stacking saves storage space, and steel frames are easy to repair v.', null, '[{"label_en":"Material","label_es":"Material","value":"Steel"},{"label_en":"Type","label_es":"Tipo","value":"Beam Formwork"},{"label_en":"Feature","label_es":"Feature","value":"Easily Assembled, Reusable, High Strength"},{"label_en":"Size","label_es":"Tamaño","value":"Customized"},{"label_en":"Certificate","label_es":"Certificate","value":"CE, ISO"},{"label_en":"Thickness","label_es":"Espesor","value":"3.0--5.0mm"}]', 'm2', 50, 15, 38, array['https://image.made-in-china.com/203f0j00TwVockOBrNpE/Steel-Framed-Timber-Formwork-Allows-Easy-Construction-and-Long-Turnover-Cy