  ('yuanxianmaoyi', 'waterproofing-membranes', 'Easy to Clean External-Pressure PVDF Modified Tubular UF Membrane Module', null, 'Easy to Clean External-Pressure PVDF Modified Tubular UF Membrane Module. Tubular Anti-Clogging Design: The open flow channel effectively prevents fiber blockage, ensuring stable and worry-free filtration for high-turbidity industrial wastewater. Sponge Ball Mechanical Cleaning: Stop frequent and costly chemical washing; our robust tubular structure supports physical scrubbing to quickly restore flux and extend membrane life. High Chemical Resistance: Withstands up to 250,000 ppm/h chlorine and aggressive cleaning agents, delivering permeate turbidity <0.1 NTU for reliable RO/NF pretreatment. Harsh Environment Adaptability: Flexible customization (OEM/ODM) makes it perfectly suited for demanding sites like landfill leachate, textile dyeing, and Middle East industrial plants.', null, '[{"label_en":"Membrane Type","label_es":"Membrane Type","value":"Hollow"},{"label_en":"Type","label_es":"Tipo","value":"UF"},{"label_en":"Product Name","label_es":"Product Name","value":"PVDF Tubular Ultrafiltration Membrane Module"},{"label_en":"Keywords","label_es":"Keywords","value":"Tubular UF Membrane Module"},{"label_en":"Filtration Precision","label_es":"Filtration Precision","value":"0.01 μm (0.01 Micron)"},{"label_en":"Molecular Weight Cut-off (Mwco)","label_es":"Molecular Weight Cut-off (Mwco)","value":"50 Kda (30 / 100 Kda Optional)"},{"label_en":"Tubular Inner Diameter","label_es":"Tubular Inner Diameter","value":"8 mm (6 / 10 / 12 mm Optional)"},{"label_en":"Membrane Area Options","label_es":"Membrane Area Options","value":"27 M² / 33 M² (Multi-Spec Option)"},{"label_en":"Module Housing Size","label_es":"Module Housing Size","value":"8-Inch Housing"},{"label_en":"Treated Water Turbidity","label_es":"Treated Water Turbidity","value":"< 0.1 Ntu"}]', 'piece', 1, 15, 2000, array['https://image.made-in-china.com/203f0j00uzBeWdkRkJgm/Easy-to-Clean-Exte