  ('ruidasteel', 'roofing-sheets', 'Pepainted Galvanized Steel Coils PPGI Color Coils Galvalume Steel Galvanized Steel Sheets', null, 'Pepainted Galvanized Steel Coils PPGI Color Coils Galvalume Steel Galvanized Steel Sheets. Comprehensive Warranty: 3-year warranty coverage for all mechanical defects and performance issues. Flexible Customization: Full customization available including size, coating, and design from samples or drawings. Fast Delivery: Standard delivery within 7 days for stock items, 15-21 days for customized orders. Wide Material Range: Zinc coating 10-350g/m2, thickness 0.085-5.0mm, width 300-1250mm. Multiple Certifications: Certified under ISO, CE, RoHS, ASTM, JIS, GB, AISI, DIN, and BS standards. Versatile Processing: Services include welding, punching, cutting, bending, and decoiling. Competitive Pricing: FOB, CIF, and CFR terms available with flexible payment options. High Production Capacity: Monthly supply capacity of 1000-3000 tons with 100% inspection.', null, '[{"label_en":"Standard","label_es":"Norma","value":"ASTM, JIS, GB, AISI, DIN, BS"},{"label_en":"Surface Treatment","label_es":"Tratamiento de superficie","value":"Galvanized"},{"label_en":"Technique","label_es":"Technique","value":"Cold Rolled"},{"label_en":"Application","label_es":"Aplicación","value":"Container Plate"},{"label_en":"Edge","label_es":"Edge","value":"Slit edge"},{"label_en":"Stock","label_es":"Stock","value":"Stock"},{"label_en":"Name","label_es":"Name","value":"PPGI Sheets"},{"label_en":"Zinc","label_es":"Zinc","value":"40-275GSM"},{"label_en":"Thickness","label_es":"Espesor","value":"0.09-3.00mm"},{"label_en":"Width","label_es":"Ancho","value":"600-1250"}]', 'ton', 25, 15, 600, array['https://image.made-in-china.com/203f0j00EgOePaWCJyrT/Pepainted-Galvanized-Steel-Coils-PPGI-Color-Coils-Galvalume-Steel-Galvanized-Steel-Sheets.webp', 'https://image.made-in-china.com/203f0j00jAkcNFZKUlzJ/Pepainted-Galvanized-Steel-Coils-PPGI-Color-Coils-Galvalume-Steel-Galvanized-Steel